    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 90,
        "text": "Hi, thanks for coming to the meeting about the library garden. I know it's a bit early.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "3ae72776dd23373110759f0fc496c8dba3b7be400ec801d0735ba25172d1723f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 94,
        "sourceEnd": 185,
        "text": "No problem. I wanted to ask—are we still planning to use the space behind the reading room?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "070f1a073bbb6555d011bd41b0b75ee6c66ad5b7bbe661a7ab17960091a3ac02",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 189,
        "sourceEnd": 289,
        "text": "Yes, that's the plan. The area gets good sunlight in the morning, which is important for vegetables.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2356010885e022f5568b766365b3cd82f7160fdea7e0b74c65197aeaa6ab0f84",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 293,
        "sourceEnd": 357,
        "text": "Right. But I heard the soil there isn't very good. Is that true?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1c5f085e2e9b4d7ee4f0a404efad746e95260dcf539be23dc492f89e78048c1d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 361,
        "sourceEnd": 471,
        "text": "Well, it's not perfect. The soil is quite sandy, so we'll need to add compost. But it's not a serious problem.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7281a1a1164feaf1ba8b7dbbed0334a007a73ccbec3468cf19dbcc0b57975caf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 475,
        "sourceEnd": 547,
        "text": "OK. And who's going to look after the plants during the summer holidays?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "624e35509835babea01533983b8f3b4121610ee3d96a89505259934adf6fc88d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 551,
        "sourceEnd": 669,
        "text": "That's a good question. We're hoping to set up a rota with volunteers. Each person would water the plants once a week.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "fa25a666d9aef4f82208ec7bc51476f76e939ba914c30a9474fdf1a0006b65f1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 673,
        "sourceEnd": 735,
        "text": "That sounds manageable. How many volunteers do we have so far?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ca5e2aae8e76b6d3f31ec8347276065a992705a658a0a04539dcceb12689b26e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 739,
        "sourceEnd": 806,
        "text": "About twelve, which should be enough. But we could always use more.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "44d676935c15375d6112a2b435bd268e10b152bc90f91d3371b66f343ec0cfcf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 810,
        "sourceEnd": 913,
        "text": "I see. Now, about the budget—I read that the council is giving us five hundred pounds. Is that correct?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "189803a62651192497dad4dd9c1c61ade4ee32ff4ff31f4efe0ab077192aadc0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 917,
        "sourceEnd": 1052,
        "text": "Actually, it's a bit more. The council agreed to give us six hundred pounds, not five hundred. That includes money for tools and seeds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "0ab09852bd0dd575d7a4a7b618d868cb3b220afc5b804f89b0200dd95d61a276",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1056,
        "sourceEnd": 1101,
        "text": "Great. So we don't need to raise extra funds?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "42f7c5f9cfd46408d5dc0a4379f7b277fe0c75052ee17f24fd6bda7008d1c383",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1105,
        "sourceEnd": 1215,
        "text": "Not for the basics. But if we want to buy a small greenhouse, we'd need to fundraise. That's optional, though.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b80ec626af1e65c80872f40eda57dfac2c5aa9832152273846dfbb159e5e1157",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1219,
        "sourceEnd": 1277,
        "text": "Understood. One more thing—when is the first planting day?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f11dd9da8a55b1823dfb71b774d84c354a4c9c221765ae2f1fc52f5b49634f2e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1281,
        "sourceEnd": 1354,
        "text": "It's on the 15th of April, a Saturday. We'll start at ten in the morning.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "3ecc123b270330959eeccee29635afcc9e3491d9dd8e75d6e37513b69c7f5202",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1358,
        "sourceEnd": 1410,
        "text": "And will there be someone to show people what to do?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "73b4c9a2290ad851cc6ca24a911633397dbd5a305211c7b3c4c9ec8b62ab6e95",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1414,
        "sourceEnd": 1523,
        "text": "Yes, a local gardener has offered to help. Her name is Sarah, and she's worked with community gardens before.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "767e0b2f027b0efbc5d44d8e5cc0e16ab6d681d3d880ff23fbf57ffcd1a58536",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1527,
        "sourceEnd": 1575,
        "text": "That's reassuring. Should people bring anything?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "fefe9070cc72f44bd3e8700c888ce1f2e751e39475cbf055360a1756bc531b4d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1579,
        "sourceEnd": 1636,
        "text": "Just gloves and a hat. We'll provide the tools and seeds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "dd0391fb2c8a1386e7d87912cfae70df62229bd0e30bf0fe69d0f9085b021ccf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1640,
        "sourceEnd": 1688,
        "text": "Perfect. I'll put a notice on the library board.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "aef3eb0b16c39ac505d774b11059582f21b2bb647c445a9ebf705069baf161f4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1692,
        "sourceEnd": 1798,
        "text": "Thanks. Oh, and one correction—the planting day is the 15th, not the 14th. I said that earlier by mistake.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "10305136f65650308c2fd0c717aa715a102a0aaef0427aa4ea179e9535ea7782",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1802,
        "sourceEnd": 1856,
        "text": "Got it. The 15th. I'll make sure the notice says that.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2c2935d956e9c3d27404874684ac6b79a92696f8ccc959ba340d3a30c7da3039",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
